{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1000_p", "source_sha256": "387b7b4b97faa73884472e92dbc988dc31c79114af50133d1f4f80dc22e3ac9f", "ja": "（今日はアイドルのみんなに、新年の抱負を考えて\nもらっている。さて、一番最初に考えつくのは……）", "zh": "（今天让偶像们全都想一想新年的抱负。那么，最先想到的会是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "d5cd961281bbdaf7a2e90894844d1315ab9f3d6d35c8a621150f0a39bbf11e3d", "ja": "シュババーと参上～ッ！\nねえねえ、兄ちゃん。亜美は何番ノリ？", "zh": "咻啦啦地登场——！\n哎哎，哥哥，亚美是第几个想出来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1002_p", "source_sha256": "13f6919829e5574c2cdf728032bab83dce3e21ea3808553eb5fc658dea8ce9df", "ja": "おお、ずいぶん早くできたな。\n亜美が一番乗りだ！", "zh": "哦，完成得真快啊。\n亚美是第一个到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "ecf1f6e282faba487eb4a7a1e1e5e56e7a6ae9d91c372ba90cd6bd8e608a3a84", "ja": "えへへ。亜美がいっちば～ん♪　実はね、\n去年から決めてたんだ。来年はこうしよーって。", "zh": "嘿嘿。亚美是第一名～♪其实呀，\n从去年开始我就决定好了。想着明年要这样做——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a1df9fbc74c528ad6bf8e0d159d54008600c225ab46ff27a38d5294c591d1a24", "ja": "去年から？　すごいじゃないか……！\nそれで、どんな抱負を考えたんだ？", "zh": "从去年就开始了？真厉害啊……！\n那么，你想的是什么新年抱负？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "5b01584842eb78823c2f5fb650b735bc88449025d5fe85b574ba7bebd7ca8f17", "ja": "……ズバリ！　『イタズラを封印して、\n兄ちゃんに迷惑をかけない』だよ♪", "zh": "……那就是！『不再恶作剧，\n不给大哥添麻烦』哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4956bf097bbb65462d62c2920080d782ecc4407333afaddf0b46321adbb34966", "ja": "こらー！　それじゃあ抱負にならないだろ……\n……え？　イタズラを、封印……？", "zh": "喂——！那根本算不上新年目标吧……\n……咦？把恶作剧，封印……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "07621129a505ab1a19000448680627ca231892f881752248f8eec67d05dd7b59", "ja": "うん。去年の亜美は、イタズラばっかだったじゃん？\nドッキリとかビックリとかウッカリとか！", "zh": "嗯。去年的亚美不是净在恶作剧嘛？\n整蛊啊、吓人啊、粗心大意啊之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "0a88a155cceed4082adad1cacaa50e9c87469f2a7d3410c158964de158643f97", "ja": "だからハンセーして、去年のことはキッパリ忘れたの\nです。今年の双海亜美はひと味違うぜ！　サッパリ！", "zh": "所以我反省过了，把去年的事忘得一干二净了。今年的双海亚美可不一样哦！清清爽爽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f466dcbf0f5172cce0600cc325d6dc27cd5f9c4272c507c0aa307cd72865b92a", "ja": "おお……！　まさか、亜美が反省する日が来るとは。\nなんだか少し、寂しい気もするけど……。", "zh": "哦……！没想到居然会有亚美反省的一天。总觉得，好像也有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "b1ad3fc7c3b98354713a91cf938ab79f4125c4665ca261ebfc82dbe86f8fe404", "ja": "へえ～。亜美がイタズラしなかったら、寂しいの？\nなんだかんだ言って……おヌシも好きよのう～♪", "zh": "原来如此～。如果亜美不恶作剧的话，你会寂寞吗？\n说到底……你也是喜欢恶作剧的嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e4ea9983f8ed8c4f77e756ee933c08746df4592e443dc175e8c1c83805db3a66", "ja": "いえいえ、お代官様こそ……じゃなくて！\nまあ、亜美の成長だと思えば、寂しいけど嬉しいよ。", "zh": "哪里哪里，大人您才是……不对不对！\n不过，要是当作亚美长大了的话，虽然会觉得寂寞，但也挺高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7814ce57c208c750835809c5e6e5c0cfad3fa2dd4e8601161d4b98cc115113e9", "ja": "さて……\nそれじゃ、抱負の紙を見せてもらっていいか？", "zh": "那么……\n那就让我看看你的新年抱负吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "81dd5058185b4d9fc487ee3ac4a70fb8c03d76b5ae1c19a8d3012abf126f0092", "ja": "どうぞどうぞ～！\nババーンと、一番目立つところに飾ってねん♪", "zh": "请看请看～！\n要“啪——”地挂在最显眼的地方哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5d16dcbeee2883f14e47c6a650c271b01fd1f9ac1ec2e3f4dc898d6fde1e0575", "ja": "どれどれ……んっ？", "zh": "我看看……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1015_null", "source_sha256": "50c28cdf0133b56a1ae36562629af5da6fadc5f4f3dea4c9ea6c62692da278fc", "ja": "『ウ　ソ　だ　よ　～　～　～　ん　！　！　』\n　　　　　　　　　(・∀・)", "zh": "『骗　你　的　啦　～～～！！』\n　　　　　　　　　(・∀・)", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "c5d06b170f27737df922ee2865d943d902c115062792685eab158845324cd212", "ja": "あはは、引っかかったー！\nこれこそ、去年から考えてたイタズラなのだ～！", "zh": "啊哈哈，上当了吧～！\n这可是亚美从去年就开始策划的恶作剧哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "42bc8f73a91260a7927edc0c2810467e6a3fc450c83f96ed6e536c513a5c5e23", "ja": "でも、兄ちゃんは怒らないよね？\n亜美のイタズラが無くなったら寂しいんだもんね？？", "zh": "不过，哥哥不会生气吧？要是没有亚美的恶作剧，你会寂寞的，对吧？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0433_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "b108fec016de8fb85da2531e701b75ede8e5f9b74bfb64d446f0f1de8e5134f5", "ja": "てことで、覚悟してね！　今年は当社比100万倍！\nたっくさんイタズラ仕掛けるから、よろよろ～♪", "zh": "所以，做好心理准备哦！今年可是比平时多100万倍！我要搞好多好多恶作剧，请多关照啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
